{"id": "DegJcfnlOZJ", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Your phone's 0% isn't empty. It's lying to you, on purpose. 🔋\n\nLithium-ion cells get damaged if drained all the way, so your phone shuts down early and keeps a hidden reserve. Even the percentage is a guess made by a tiny fuel-gauge chip, which is why it panics on cold days.\n\nStop running it to zero. Roughly 20–80% keeps the battery younger.\n\nSend this to the friend who's always on 1% 😅\n\n#battery #smartphone #techexplained #howtechworks #phonetips", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792049409, "like_count": 31, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140270959575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.232, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMbW_6oPWr5lc68oTJGPQBkHr0SXfOyAZsSFK8jLADW0WpV6vf8wrNAc0M4FPVh_UKDqc2t0xKMc4XMYuijayoLxBY6M8wFDen5gnQ.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoNkmta0UXveo-5xh-xsBqqHl6417GPl-VU5ifVNZSFtA_2JBW4V7pE_HOJnTd__1BtFOFD4n_7BLBfnUyqW9K7&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=-PU1YYCFE3gQ7kNvwGrXRS3&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=vzmF9mH8g6RgFEAxK443jA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQj3my0rqOu8ZMb7iRI6ZIL5xa8WLPAttgK5cAv1RSJvA&oe=6AF43682", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 62.232, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-181402709595